* ''Plaintext survives to disk'' (operator, 2026-11-11: //"Plaintext survives to disk"//, re-affirming 2026-11-10). Every layer that holds a face's content keeps a cleartext mirror that seeds back across a re-founding: the workbench through its one folder `wikis/<slug>` (beside the source for a checkout-sourced wiki) or its workspace, once for its document (operator, 2026-11-14: //"most wikis should NOT seed per-face because shared crdts, while daemon wikis should seed per-face. Same with import/export."//), `personal` through `personal/<F>/<slug>`, the daemon tiers through `wikis/daemon-<F>` and `bags/daemon-<F>`.

